{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "A Day With Vanessa", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Walking and Talking", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 1, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 16, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts. ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Talking About the Future - If, When, Before and After", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use time clauses to give information about time and sequence.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the words If, When, Before and After in time clauses.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the first conditional with these time clauses.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The structure is:<br/>If/When/Before/After + Subject + Simple Present tense, Subject + will + Simple Present tense", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Before</span> means at an earlier time.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">After</span> means at a later time.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">Before I go to sleep, I'll set my alarm.<br/>After I set my alarm, I'll go to sleep.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">If</span> means on the condition that ...", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">If I go to sleep, I'll set my alarm.</span> (I'm not sure that I'll go to sleep.)", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">When</span> means at the time of doing something.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">When I go to bed, I'll set my alarm.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When I see one at the store, I'll call you! ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "After I get home tonight, I'll try and get creative. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Before I go in tomorrow, I'll send you a list of ideas to write about. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "If you send me a text to remind me, I won't forget! ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Showing You Understand Someone's Feelings or Emotions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "In conversation, it is natural to show that you understand someone's feelings and emotions. It helps to use different kinds of structures and expressions.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use the structures:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You<span class=\"strong\"> ought to be/must be</span> + adjective<br/>It <span class=\"strong\">ought to be</span>/must be + adjective<br/>You've/It's <span class=\"strong\">got to be</span> + adjective<br/>I'm sure that's/you're + adjective<br/>Aren't you + adjective?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can also use these expressions:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">I get it.<br/>I know what you mean.<br/>I hear you.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You must be freezing in that tank top, Sally!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You've got to be boiling in that duffel coat. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": " Aren't you tired of inventing new dishes every week?", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "duffel coat", "type": "name"}, {"content": " a warm coat made of duffel (a kind of wool)", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You've got to be boiling in that duffel coat.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about jobs and work.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "material", "type": "name"}, {"content": "facts, information or ideas", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm running out of material to blog about.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to invent", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to create something new", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Aren't you tired of inventing new dishes every week?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to manage", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be in charge of; to supervise", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I wish I didn't have to be managing people sometimes. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "on a daily basis", "type": "name"}, {"content": "every day", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm sure it's hard to be creative on a daily basis. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to bring up", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to mention; to begin a discussion", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You can bring them up with your boss.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob01aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn7le16ob01re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Think about your job or school.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "What do you wish were different?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a \u201cwish list\u201d of things that you wish were different in your job or school.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your wishes with a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I consider what I wish were different at work or school.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I make a list of wishes.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I discuss my wishes with a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le16ob01re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le16ob01re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It's such a beautiful spring day! You must be freezing in that tank top, Sally!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         Ha, I'm good - you've got to be boiling in that duffel coat. It's really nice, though. I wish I had one, too. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     When I see one at the store, I'll call you! How's life at <span class=\"italic\">Cambridge Life</span>?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         It's ok. I'm running out of material to blog about. After I get home tonight, I'll try and get creative."}, {"image": "engenn7le16ob01re2img05.jpg", "time": "24000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     I'm sure it's hard to be creative on a daily basis. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         Aren't you tired of inventing new dishes every week? How's work, by the way?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     Work is good. I wish I didn't have to be managing people sometimes. They can be very difficult.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         That ought to be really stressful. You know, I could blog about your restaurant ... or about being a chef at a restaurant!"}, {"image": "engenn7le16ob01re2img02.jpg", "time": "46000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     Before I go in tomorrow, I'll send you a list of ideas to write about. You can bring them up with your boss.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         You don't have to do that ... I'm sure you're very busy!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     It's no problem at all. If you send me a text to remind me, I won't forget!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le16ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le16ob01re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about feelings and reactions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can discuss jobs and work by talking about future action using <span class=\"italic\">if</span>, <s